				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>带上它挖掘。不带它战斗。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 它没有配方，也不出现在任何战利品表中，只能通过与小矮人交易获得。"
			]
			id: "0C2E0D5D1D3BA3A7"
			subtitle: "戒指插槽"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3AFA63262B283335"
				item: "terramity:gnome_ring"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>被动地赋予 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>速度 I</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>激活后提供 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>速度 IV</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，持续 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>15 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并使你在相同时间内持续燃烧，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>45 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 着火并非只有坏处。红宝石戒指能在你燃烧时提供力量，两者搭配起来效果显著。"
			]
			id: "7220760843871D2E"
			subtitle: "戒指插槽"
			tasks: [{
				id: "121BE872BC91E8D8"
				item: "terramity:burning_spirit_ring"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.5d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>25 百分比</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 缩短每个冲刺的冷却时间。不可叠加。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>模组里所有能让你冲刺的腰带，装上这个都会变强，所以这是移动向构筑永远不会摘下的唯一戒指。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>托帕石、铱和一枚空戒指。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "32F6A357865057EC"
			subtitle: "戒指插槽"
			tasks: [{
				id: "522E69207E5C38B4"
				item: "terramity:agility_ring"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"所有技能的冷却时间缩短25%。此效果不可叠加。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一块棱镜宝石、仙女粉尘和一个空戒指。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>可与Gundalf's Pointed Hat和Nyxium Knight套装叠加，分别位于完全不同的装备栏位，叠加率分别为25%和20%。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "7074FE0A7BD7CE43"
			subtitle: "戒指插槽"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6445432997680069"
				item: "terramity:prismatic_ring"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E29AD2 to=#FFDCF5 f=0.8>30%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>缩短所有技能的冷却时间。不可叠加。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>棱镜环周围的彩色羊毛和反物质。比它能吞噬的环好得多。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "40156F8EEDC53DA7"
			subtitle: "戒指插槽"
			tasks: [{
